WEBVTT

00:04:57.356 --> 00:05:01.956
that have to respond most directly
to the impacts of climate change:

00:05:01.996 --> 00:05:04.036
heatwaves, floods, hurricanes.

00:05:04.076 --> 00:05:06.676
We have to deal with the implications.

00:05:06.716 --> 00:05:09.516
Now, for Scotland,
California and New South Wales

00:05:09.556 --> 00:05:11.476
that's difficult but manageable.

00:05:11.516 --> 00:05:14.596
For many others
across the world, it is not.

00:05:14.636 --> 00:05:17.276
So climate justice matters, too.

00:05:17.276 --> 00:05:21.716
It’s not enough to cut our own emissions,
although that is vital;

00:05:21.756 --> 00:05:24.356
we have to make sure we are helping those

00:05:24.356 --> 00:05:27.396
who have done the least
to cause climate change

00:05:27.396 --> 00:05:29.276
to do so too.

00:05:29.276 --> 00:05:32.636
And with the spirit
of justice and fairness